					<div class="wanted-poster">
						<div class="poster-art"><span class="poster-scan"></span><div class="poster-portrait" role="img" aria-label="Animated cyberpunk portrait of Samuel Tariku"><img class="portrait-frame portrait-frame-1" src="/images/1.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><img class="portrait-frame portrait-frame-2" src="/images/2.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><img class="portrait-frame portrait-frame-3" src="/images/3.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><span class="poster-stamp">PLAYER<br />01</span><span class="poster-coordinate">09°01' N<br />38°45' E</span></div>
						<div class="poster-copy"><p class="micro"><span class="status-light"></span> ACTIVE OPERATIVE · ADDIS ABABA</p><h2>Samuel<br /><em>Tariku</em></h2><p class="poster-role">FULL-STACK ENGINEER <span>//</span> WEB + MOBILE</p><p class="poster-description">Builds the systems behind the screen: multi-tenant platforms, real-time products, and sharp customer experiences.</p><div class="poster-stats"><div><span>CLASS</span><b>ENGINEER</b></div><div><span>HOME SECTOR</span><b>ADDIS ABABA</b></div><div><span>KNOWN ALIAS</span><b>SAMI</b></div></div><div class="poster-bottom"><span>IDENTITY VERIFIED</span><span>ST-001 // ETH</span></div></div>
					</div>
				</section>

