						<div class="music-intro"><p class="micro">LISTEN IN</p><h2>Check out my music.</h2><a class="music-link" href="https://soundcloud.com/samuel-tariku" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">OPEN SOUNDCLOUD PROFILE <span>↗</span></a></div>
						<div class="soundcloud-slider" aria-label="Featured SoundCloud tracks">
							<div class="soundcloud-tracks" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scroll through four featured tracks">
