					<div class="socials"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/samuel-tariku-a7a389113/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LINKEDIN ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/SamuelTariku/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GITHUB ↗</a><a href="https://soundcloud.com/samuel-tariku" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">SOUNDCLOUD ↗</a></div>
				</section>
				<footer><a href="#top">ST // RETURN TO MENU ↑</a><span>© 2026 SAMUEL TARIKU</span></footer>
